Z||000000||KnightRyder31||10-06-2000||08:10 PM||||What do you guys think of this? <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>51,000 original miles on V6 engine<BR>Needs paint job, and front left light cover.<BR>Interior in good cond.<BR>5-speed manual<BR>price- $900.00 or best offer.<P>I just looked at it today, and I was wondering what you guys think.<BR>The guy said he would accept a trade for my car. I have a 84 coupe with 71,000 miles, almost mint.||||reg||1
Z||000001||gixxer||10-06-2000||08:25 PM||||If it doesn't have a VTEC engine, it's not worth having. ;p <BR>Sounds good to me, 'tho I'd check the front suspension out with a fast drive down the highway.||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfiero||10-06-2000||09:01 PM||||If you don't buy it relay the guys info to me.....I'd be interested in it.||||reg||1
